1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,288
You spent hours tracking dinner.

2
00:00:02,288 --> 00:00:03,638
Dinner ran away.

3
00:00:03,638 --> 00:00:06,138
So, does your prehistoric camp
go hungry?

4
00:00:06,138 --> 00:00:07,675
Not necessarily.

5
00:00:08,425 --> 00:00:11,112
Hunting was only part of the
food story.

6
00:00:11,112 --> 00:00:13,538
Depending on the place and
season, people

7
00:00:13,538 --> 00:00:15,725
also gathered edible plants and
caught

8
00:00:15,725 --> 00:00:17,275
smaller animals.

9
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,612
Knowing where to look mattered.

10
00:00:19,612 --> 00:00:21,775
So did knowing what not to eat.

11
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,350
Meanwhile, other people were
gathering

12
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,912
fuel, preparing food, and
maintaining

13
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:27,900
tools.

14
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,100
Your failed hunt was one part of
the day,

15
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:34,138
not everyone's entire survival
plan.

16
00:00:34,138 --> 00:00:36,462
Sharing work and resources
helped people

17
00:00:36,462 --> 00:00:38,250
handle uncertainty.

18
00:00:38,975 --> 00:00:41,000
Tonight's meal might be modest.

19
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,950
But at least nobody asks why you
didn't

20
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,650
just order delivery.
